Project name: A StudentHub portal 

Objective: Creat a user-friendly StudentHub portal that will allow students to do multiple tasks

Stakeholders: 

1) Students
2) Teachers
3) Website administrators
4) Payment gateway providers
5) Admin team

Functional Requirements:

1) Login page:

> Students/Teachers/Admin staff can access their accounts using their respective Ids
> User Authentication should be secured
> Provide links to the institute's social media(Instagram,Linkedin etc.)

2) Dashboard:

> Can show 4 main functions and provide links to modules
> Should also provide link to profile and logout
> Should be slightly different depending on whether the student/teacher/admin has logged in

3) Attendance (the first of four main functions)

> Teachers can view their own attendance and also input attendance for all the students in their class/es
> Students can view their attendance for all the subjects of the day
> Admin can only view their own attendance

4) Fee payment

5) Time table

6) Menu

7) Profile

8) Module

9) Event participation

10)Leave 
